  "https://dmhsus.org/events/": "Deconstructing the Mental Health System (Seattle 501c3). Refused from TWO independent networks, which is what settles it: this sandbox gets 202 with an sgcaptcha body on every path including /robots.txt, and a GitHub runner (172.208.127.83, an entirely different provider) gets a 403 on every path including /robots.txt. An earlier note here guessed the block was IP reputation against a datacenter address, because the challenge URL carries the caller's IP in its y= parameter; the two-network probe disproved that. The site is closed to automated clients, robots.txt cannot be read to establish permission, and we do not impersonate a browser to get round bot management - same line as sfbike.org. Re-probe with catalog_probe.py if that ever changes; the calendar itself is worth having. The route that does not depend on their WAF is to ask the org for an iCal feed."
 }
